Hi there,

If you remember Prisma mainly as an ORM, here=E2=80=99s the quick reintrodu=
ction: Prisma now gives your coding agent a Postgres database, a type-safe =
data layer, and hosting in one platform.

Here=E2=80=99s what=E2=80=99s new:

=E2=80=A2 *Ship with Prisma Compute:* Deploy your TypeScript app next to it=
s database with one command, giving every branch an isolated environment fo=
r safer testing and faster queries without a cross-provider network hop. =
=E2=80=A2 *Build more for free:* You now get 200,000 Postgres operations an=
d 1 million Compute requests each month. You can start without a credit car=
d, with usage capped at the included limits. =E2=80=A2 *Build with Prisma 8=
:* The ORM has been rebuilt in TypeScript to be faster, lighter, and easier=
 for coding agents to work with, while keeping Prisma=E2=80=99s declarative=
, type-safe workflow.

Your existing account is ready when you are.

